longdesc Hyphenation, and Spaced words Latin abbreviations Acronyms and
longdesc Abbreviations Itemization, nonlocal lists and labels
longdesc Parenthetical and serial commas Non-local tokenization in
longdesc language through Abbreviations and pronouns.
