longdesc performs a similar function to that of draftcopy, but its
longdesc implementation is output device independent. As of December
longdesc 2020, the package relies on the new shipout hooks directly
longdesc provided by LaTeX. For users of older versions of LaTeX, the
longdesc package also provides a legacy version of itself (that is
