longdesc Inria is a free font designed by Black[Foundry] for Inria
longdesc research institute. The font is available for free. It comes as
longdesc Serif and Sans Serif, each with three weights and matching
longdesc italics. Using these fonts with XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX is easy
