name leporello
category Package
revision 76924
shortdesc A simple LaTeX document class to create folded leaflets using columns and boxes
relocated 1
longdesc A simple LaTeX document class to create folded leaflets with
longdesc the following key features: The document layout consists of a
longdesc specific number of pages that can have varying widths and are
longdesc placed next to each other. Each page contains one frame to
longdesc contain typeset material. Material is typeset in boxes, and
longdesc boxes are positioned in columns which in turn are placed into
longdesc the frames on the pages of the document. Columns are predefined
longdesc and then placed into the frame of a page in the document
longdesc layout. This way, columns can be used on pages with varying
longdesc widths. Boxes can have padding (including bleed) and a
longdesc background and are positioned inside a column.
